The <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/09/09/apple-watch-ultra-4-announced-battery-life/">Apple Watch Ultra 4</a> arrives three years after the Ultra 2. Across those two generations, Apple added satellite connectivity, a larger display, new health sensors, and longer battery life. Are those changes enough to justify replacing an Ultra 2 or paying more for the newest model?<br/>
